cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PAL2v-ROS: Paraconsistent Annotated Logic with two-valued annotation for ROS 2"
abstract: "Pure-Python library of the Paraconsistent Annotated Logic with two-valued annotation (PAL2v) and ROS 2 nodes for fault-tolerant fusion of redundant sensors, with the Gazebo (TurtleBot3) and PX4 SITL experiments of the accompanying paper."
authors:
  - family-names: "Lima"
    given-names: "Alessandro Ferreira Paz"
    affiliation: "Universidade Santa Cecília (UNISANTA)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/alefplima/PAL2v-ROS"
keywords:
  - paraconsistent logic
  - PAL2v
  - sensor fusion
  - fault tolerance
  - ROS 2
  - PX4
  - Gazebo
